.TH BINPARSE 1
.SH NAME
binparse \- inspect ELF, Mach-O, and PE executable structure
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B binparse
.RB [ \-\-format " json|text" ]
.I binary
.SH DESCRIPTION
Reads executable metadata without executing the target. JSON is the default
output format. The report includes the detected format, architecture, byte
order, entry point, sections, symbols, and available DWARF summary data.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-format
Select JSON or concise text output.
.TP
.B \-\-version
Print the program version.
.SH EXIT STATUS
0 on success, 2 for invalid arguments, and 4 for an unreadable or unsupported
binary.
